    <transition source="3" target="1" event="6" />
  </data>
</model>

E3: controls the followers cycle of messages. Robots broadcast
their colour and identification code until they receive an offer for their colour. When this
occurs, they send an acceptance message and join the group. When a follower joins a group,
it relays the messages it receives, using an echo function triggered by controllable event sendE

<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
